  heading "Life & welcome"
  one neos-alive    "NeoOS liveliness pulse + vitality score (uptime, load, mem, disk...)"
  one neos-welcome  "Interactive landing banner (logo + vitals + tip of the day)"

  heading "Network"
  one neos-net   "Network diagnostics (interfaces, gateway, DNS, ping)"
